swap-announce-overwrites-pending	js/client/play.js: peer SWAP handler (about line 1929 in the working tree) refuses a same-file, same-hash re-announce with a later tick while it still holds the first tick. Fix: accept that re-announce in place of the pending record (refuse only a different file or hash), so the peer and the host move to the same tick; reuse peerFetch for the new record.
